   "title": "80 Years of ZOLLER – Looking Ahead",
   "lead": "<p>At EMO 2025, Christoph Zoller spoke with Robert Fraunberger, Editor-in-Chief of the trade magazine x-technik Fertigungstechnik. Christoph Zoller reflected on defining milestones in the company’s 80-year history and offered a glimpse into the future of digitally networked manufacturing. The discussion focused on the high standards of precision and quality, as well as the central role of the toolroom as the heart of an efficient production environment.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "quote",
     "text": "<p> Our goal is to help our customers around the world manufacture more productively, efficiently, and successfully. </p>",
